{"2440500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HeroSquare", "steam_appid": 2440500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c3f3cf3ab7eff3e270abb9b507cc4b3d.poster.avif?t=1765524435\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c3f3cf3ab7eff3e270abb9b507cc4b3d.webm?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c3f3cf3ab7eff3e270abb9b507cc4b3d.mp4?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start on an epic adventure of square proportions! Explore mysterious zones, conquer challenging puzzles, and engage in thrilling battles with fierce foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the full potential of your hero by collecting powerful items scattered throughout the land. The greatest of adventurers will discover hidden treasures waiting for only the bravest of explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/c96c83e9cae49900569f592f11b6812c.avif?t=1765524435\" width=231 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry bullets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once discovered, the <i>Parry Bullet</i> power allows you to parry incoming bullets and reflect them back at enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/00fd1f182bb2fbcd42d067a163d92948.poster.avif?t=1765524435\" width=400 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/00fd1f182bb2fbcd42d067a163d92948.webm?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/00fd1f182bb2fbcd42d067a163d92948.mp4?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore for secrets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does it look like a good fit? In HeroSquare secrets are everywhere, and good positioning is the key to many of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/f149500fedeb685ef7cf708fcbeed7f9.poster.avif?t=1765524435\" width=400 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/f149500fedeb685ef7cf708fcbeed7f9.webm?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/f149500fedeb685ef7cf708fcbeed7f9.mp4?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventure you will add new abilities and upgrades to your arsenal. Master them to reach the finale of HeroSquare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/9420fe936925df3a5e14db8fd3ec9f97.poster.avif?t=1765524435\" width=400 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/9420fe936925df3a5e14db8fd3ec9f97.webm?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/9420fe936925df3a5e14db8fd3ec9f97.mp4?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Triumph in battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face tough bosses determined to stop your progress. However there's always a way forward, especially if one looks around a bit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/30754436a724dd07827f36f46b8dcf1b.poster.avif?t=1765524435\" width=400 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/30754436a724dd07827f36f46b8dcf1b.webm?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/30754436a724dd07827f36f46b8dcf1b.mp4?t=1765524435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/050b274886784e8d36b99e8fbbda0bc1.avif?t=1765524435\" width=231 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We find our hero stranded under the stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you ended up here is a mystery, and so is the exact nature of this colorful world, that you find yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One memory however remains, something once had, but now lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in this world, a heart awaits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po